WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.715
- Hey man I was thinking maybe

00:00:02.715 --> 00:00:05.640
we should like hangout sometime.

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:09.552
Grab a beer, a brew,
engineer something together,

00:00:09.552 --> 00:00:10.974
have a picnic, do sports.

00:00:12.764 --> 00:00:13.723
No, that's stupid.

00:00:14.479 --> 00:00:15.901
Okay. Whatever I got this.

00:00:17.121 --> 00:00:18.055
Wish me luck.

00:00:20.239 --> 00:00:22.605
- Five tips to a more productive day.

00:00:23.771 --> 00:00:26.364
Number 1: Listening to
music that's where you zone

00:00:26.364 --> 00:00:28.741
and sends a message to
coworkers that you are not

00:00:28.741 --> 00:00:29.997
to be bothered.

00:00:30.499 --> 00:00:32.872
Okay. I could do this.

00:00:33.652 --> 00:00:35.747
- So, it's just a friendly
softball tournament

00:00:35.913 --> 00:00:37.498
so there's nothing really riding on it.

00:00:37.498 --> 00:00:39.500
But I still think we need
to come in first place.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:40.962
- Girl, I am comfortable with that.

00:00:40.962 --> 00:00:43.380
- Harper and Kaylen are in.

00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:45.422
Oh, and Charlie played
baseball in college.

00:00:45.422 --> 00:00:46.722
- Oh, how do you know that?

00:00:46.722 --> 00:00:47.891
- His wife's Facebook.

00:00:47.891 --> 00:00:49.516
- Oh...

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:52.015
- He dosen't have a personal Facebook

00:00:52.015 --> 00:00:54.057
so sometimes I go there for updates.

00:00:54.057 --> 00:00:58.539
- So, we should ask
him to play then right?

00:00:58.539 --> 00:01:00.731
- That is a great idea, Anna.

00:01:00.731 --> 00:01:03.196
I was just going to ask him to coach me.

00:01:03.941 --> 00:01:05.607
- You mean coach the team?

00:01:05.607 --> 00:01:08.072
- You are full of ideas today.

00:01:08.239 --> 00:01:10.697
- Number 2: Learn how to say no.

00:01:10.697 --> 00:01:15.370
It's all about setting
boundaries and prioritizing.

00:01:15.370 --> 00:01:18.668
Prioritizing isn't a word, dude.

00:01:18.915 --> 00:01:21.374
- Charlie, we were setting
up a softball league.

00:01:21.374 --> 00:01:22.461
- We want you to play short stop?

00:01:22.461 --> 00:01:23.294
- No.

00:01:23.294 --> 00:01:24.381
- But what if we offered you...

00:01:24.381 --> 00:01:25.671
- No.

00:01:26.291 --> 00:01:27.926
- I hear what you're saying,

00:01:27.926 --> 00:01:29.084
and I'm going to veto it.

00:01:29.084 --> 00:01:29.673
- No.

00:01:29.673 --> 00:01:31.299
- Please do this for us?

00:01:32.529 --> 00:01:33.428
- No.

00:01:34.682 --> 00:01:37.851
- I know I will write Charlie
an email leave a paper trail.

00:01:37.851 --> 00:01:40.137
Everything should have a paper trail.

00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:44.485
Dear Charlie, Bromance?

00:01:44.485 --> 00:01:46.324
Hope all is well.

00:01:46.324 --> 00:01:48.272
Best, Elliot.

00:01:50.204 --> 00:01:51.294
Send.

00:01:53.079 --> 00:01:54.193
Now we wait.

00:01:54.369 --> 00:01:57.952
- Number 3: Only check
emails at the end of the day.

00:01:57.952 --> 00:02:01.334
You only got to tell me twice.

00:02:02.090 --> 00:02:03.295
Allright.

00:02:11.091 --> 00:02:13.011
- Elliot, we're starting
a softball league.

00:02:13.011 --> 00:02:13.844
- You're the short stop.

00:02:13.844 --> 00:02:15.798
- But doesn't Charlie play short stop?

00:02:15.798 --> 00:02:16.844
- Not anymore.

00:02:16.844 --> 00:02:18.679
- I can't play short stop.

00:02:18.679 --> 00:02:20.091
- Thanks for cooperating.

00:02:20.975 --> 00:02:22.021
- I can play team mom.

00:02:23.132 --> 00:02:25.150
- Number 4: Drink more water.

00:02:28.107 --> 00:02:29.271
You got it.

00:02:31.784 --> 00:02:33.196
- Hey man you gonna get coffee or ...

00:02:33.196 --> 00:02:34.330
- No.

00:02:35.248 --> 00:02:36.651
- Cool. I hate coffee.

00:02:36.955 --> 00:02:38.292
See ya bro.

00:02:38.916 --> 00:02:40.409
You were right, Mr Harris.

00:02:40.409 --> 00:02:43.422
I don't deserve something
as special as a bromance.

00:02:44.283 --> 00:02:46.423
- Elliot, my man, I
meant to ask you earlier

00:02:46.423 --> 00:02:47.967
are you busy this weekend?

00:02:47.967 --> 00:02:48.678
- The weekend ... never.

00:02:48.678 --> 00:02:49.674
- Perfect. Do you want to grab a beer?

00:02:49.674 --> 00:02:51.055
- I would love to have a picnic with you

00:02:51.055 --> 00:02:52.589
- Picnic?

00:02:52.589 --> 00:02:55.180
Okay, yeah, you know what screw it.

00:02:55.180 --> 00:02:55.972
Let's do a picnic.

00:02:55.972 --> 00:02:56.927
We'll talk about it later.

00:02:56.927 --> 00:02:58.055
I got to run to the bathroom.

00:02:58.055 --> 00:02:59.355
I've been drinking water all day

00:02:59.355 --> 00:03:00.269
so like bladder ...

00:03:01.259 --> 00:03:02.474
- Yeah. totally.

00:03:02.474 --> 00:03:04.187
- All right man.

00:03:09.778 --> 00:03:10.698
- Yes.

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:11.993
- [Anna] Come on you can do it.

00:03:11.993 --> 00:03:12.785
You're doing it.

00:03:12.785 --> 00:03:15.447
- [Elliot] I usually
cry when I play sports.

00:03:15.447 --> 00:03:17.076
- [ Anna] All right thank you very much.

00:03:17.076 --> 00:03:18.541
See you on the field.

